[I] Client lib for libsignal-c

[T] axc is a client library for libsignal-protocol-c that implements the
[T] needed database and crypto interfaces using SQLite and gcrypt. It also
[T] provides utility functions for common use cases like encrypting and
[T] decrypting, making direct use of libsignal unnecessary; it is used by
[T] the OMEMO plugin for libpurple.

[U] https://github.com/gkdr/axc

[A] Axc Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

